# UI Rules

- Use Vue 3 composition API.
- Use TypeScript.
- Use accessible form controls.
- Support keyboard navigation.
- Provide visible focus states.
- Do not rely on color alone for status.
- Require useful image alt text.
- Use responsive layouts.
- Keep complex administration desktop first.
- Prioritize campaign creation, preview, approval, and member lookup on mobile.
- Do not duplicate domain rules in components.
- Use shared validation schemas where appropriate.
- Handle loading, empty, error, and success states explicitly.
- Avoid inline styles.
- Avoid `!important`.
